## Safety Checklist

### Before removing ANYTHING:

- [ ] Run detection tools (composer unused, npx knip, npx depcheck)
- [ ] Grep for all references (rg "ClassName" app/ resources/)
- [ ] Check dynamic imports/resolution (Inertia::render, dynamic component loading)
- [ ] Review git history (git log --follow [file])
- [ ] Check if used by external services (APIs, webhooks, queues)
- [ ] Run ALL tests (php artisan test && npm run test)
- [ ] Create backup branch (git checkout -b refactor/cleanup-backup)
- [ ] Document in docs/DELETION_LOG.md

### After EACH removal:

- [ ] Backend build succeeds (composer install, no errors)
- [ ] Frontend build succeeds (npm run build)
- [ ] Backend tests pass (php artisan test)
- [ ] Frontend tests pass (npm run test)
- [ ] TypeScript compiles (npm run type-check)
- [ ] No console errors (check browser console)
- [ ] PHPStan passes (./vendor/bin/phpstan analyse)
- [ ] ESLint passes (npm run lint)
- [ ] Commit changes (git commit -m "refactor: remove unused X")
- [ ] Update docs/DELETION_LOG.md

## Common Patterns to Remove

### Backend (Laravel/PHP)

#### 1. Unused PHP Imports

```php
<?php
// ❌ Remove unused imports
use App\Models\Market;
use App\Models\User;
use App\Services\MarketService; // Not used

// ✅ Keep only what's used
use App\Models\Market;
use App\Models\User;
```

#### 2. Unused Controller Methods

```php
<?php
// ❌ Remove methods not referenced in routes
class MarketController extends Controller
{
    public function index() { /* ... */ }

    // Not in routes/web.php
    public function oldMethod() { /* ... */ }
}

// ✅ Remove oldMethod()
```

#### 3. Unused Services/Repositories

```php
<?php
// ❌ Service not injected anywhere
class OldMarketService
{
    // No usages found
}

// ✅ Delete the entire file
```

#### 4. Unused Helper Functions

```php
<?php
// ❌ app/Helpers/helpers.php
function oldHelper() {
    // Not called anywhere
}

// ✅ Remove the function
```

#### 5. Unused Form Requests

```php
<?php
// ❌ Not used in any controller
class OldMarketRequest extends FormRequest
{
    // No references
}

// ✅ Delete the file
```

#### 6. Unused Composer Dependencies

```json
// ❌ composer.json
{
    "require": {
        "guzzlehttp/guzzle": "^7.0", // Not imported anywhere
        "league/csv": "^9.0" // Replaced by native PHP
    }
}

// ✅ Remove from composer.json and run composer update
```

### Frontend (Vue 3/TypeScript)

#### 1. Unused Vue Imports

```typescript
// ❌ Remove unused imports
import { defineComponent, computed, watch, ref } from 'vue'; // Only defineComponent used

// ✅ Keep only what's used
import { defineComponent } from 'vue';
```

#### 2. Unused Vue Components

```vue
<!-- ❌ Component not imported anywhere -->
<!-- resources/js/components/OldButton.vue -->
<template>
    <button>Old Button</button>
</template>

<!-- ✅ Delete the entire file -->
```

#### 3. Dead Code Branches

```typescript
// ❌ Remove unreachable code
if (false) {
    // This never executes
    doSomething();
}

// ❌ Remove unused methods
export default defineComponent({
    methods: {
        unusedMethod() {
            // Not called anywhere
        },
    },
});
```

#### 4. Duplicate Vue Components

```typescript
// ❌ Multiple similar components
resources / js / components / Button.vue;
resources / js / components / PrimaryButton.vue;
resources / js / components / NewButton.vue;

// ✅ Consolidate to one with props
resources / js / components / Button.vue;
// Props: variant: 'primary' | 'secondary' | 'danger'
```

#### 5. Unused TypeScript Types

```typescript
// ❌ resources/js/types/index.d.ts
export interface OldInterface {
    // Not used anywhere
}

// ✅ Remove the interface
```

#### 6. Unused NPM Dependencies

```json
// ❌ package.json
{
    "dependencies": {
        "lodash": "^4.17.21", // Not imported anywhere
        "moment": "^2.29.4" // Replaced by date-fns
    }
}

// ✅ Remove and run npm install
```

### Both Backend and Frontend

#### Commented-Out Code

```php
// ❌ Old commented code
// function oldFunction() {
//   return 'old';
// }

// ✅ Delete it completely (it's in git history)
```

#### Unused Inertia Pages

```php
// ❌ Backend: Inertia::render never called
Inertia::render('OldPage/Index');

// ❌ Frontend: File exists but not rendered
resources/js/pages/OldPage/Index.vue

// ✅ Delete both if not used
```

## Laravel + Vue 3 + Inertia.js Project-Specific Rules

### 🔴 CRITICAL - NEVER REMOVE (Without Team Discussion):

#### Backend (Laravel)

- **Authentication System**: app/Http/Controllers/Auth/\*, routes/auth.php
- **Core Models**: app/Models/User.php (and primary business models)
- **Service Providers**: app/Providers/\* (especially AppServiceProvider, AuthServiceProvider)
- **Middleware**: app/Http/Middleware/\* (especially auth, Inertia, HandleInertiaRequests)
- **Database Migrations**: database/migrations/\* (deployed migrations)
- **Configuration Files**: config/\* (critical for app behavior)
- **Core Routes**: routes/web.php auth routes
- **Policies**: app/Policies/\* (authorization logic)
- **Jobs**: app/Jobs/\* (queued tasks may be scheduled)
- **Events/Listeners**: Check EventServiceProvider before removing
- **Scheduled Tasks**: Check app/Console/Kernel.php schedule

#### Frontend (Vue 3 + Inertia)

- **App Entry Points**: resources/js/app.ts, resources/js/ssr.ts
- **Layout Components**: resources/js/layouts/\* (used by multiple pages)
- **Auth Components**: Login.vue, Register.vue, authentication flows
- **Core Composables/Utils**: Shared utilities used across app
- **Inertia Configuration**: HandleInertiaRequests middleware
- **Global Components**: Components registered in app.ts
- **TypeScript Config**: tsconfig.json, vite.config.ts

### 🟢 SAFE TO REMOVE (After Verification):

#### Backend

- Unused helper functions in app/Helpers/
- Old commented-out code in controllers
- Test factories for deleted features
- Unused Form Requests (check controller usage)
- Unused Repository/Service classes (verify no DI)
- Unused console commands (check Kernel.php)

#### Frontend

- Old unused Vue components (verify no imports)
- Deprecated utility functions (check usage with grep)
- Test files for deleted features
- Unused TypeScript types/interfaces
- Old commented-out code blocks
- Unused icons/images in public/

### 🟡 ALWAYS VERIFY BEFORE REMOVING:

#### Backend (Laravel)

- **Controllers**: Check routes/web.php for usage
- **Models**: Check relationships, factories, seeders
- **Services**: Check dependency injection in controllers
- **Repositories**: Check service layer usage
- **Form Requests**: Check controller type hints
- **Policies**: Check authorize() calls and gates
- **Routes**: Check if used by frontend or external APIs
- **Middleware**: Check route definitions and Kernel.php
- **Events**: Check where event() is called
- **Jobs**: Check dispatch() calls and schedules
- **Migrations**: NEVER delete deployed migrations

#### Frontend (Vue 3)

- **Vue Components**: Search for imports across all .vue files
- **Inertia Pages**: Check Inertia::render() calls in controllers
- **Composables**: Check imports in components (if using any)
- **Types**: Check usage across TypeScript files
- **Assets**: Check references in components and public/
- **Utilities**: Grep for function usage

#### Both

- **Inertia Shared Data**: Check HandleInertiaRequests middleware
- **Routes**: Verify no external services depend on them
- **API Endpoints**: Check if mobile apps or webhooks use them

